\title{bharatpii: Indian Identifier Detection and Privacy Auditing}
\description{
Detects and structurally validates Indian personal identifiers in data frames, including Aadhaar (Verhoeff checksum), PAN, GSTIN, IFSC, UPI virtual payment addresses, mobile numbers, postal PIN codes and Voter ID (EPIC). Supports k-anonymity re-identification risk assessment, masking, salted hashing and generalisation of flagged columns, and technical audit reports informed by India's Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act, 2023. Validity checks do not prove that an identifier was ever issued.
